==About==
<section begin="Intro"/>'''RLCS 2021-22 ''' is the eleventh season of the [[Rocket League Championship Series]]. This season introduces major changes to the RLCS system with more regions and an updated format. 3 splits - Fall, Winter, Spring - each having 3 regional events leading into an international major. Within all these events, each team collected points that determined whether they would qualify for the World Championship or World Championship Wildcard.<section end="Intro"/>

The '''RLCS 2021-22 World Championship''' took place in Fort Worth, United States at the [https://dickiesarena.com/ Dickies Arena].

