===Format===
[[File:Swiss System Graphic.png|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]
*'''Wildcard''' - ''August 4th - 7th, 2022''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format.
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
** <span class="bg-up">Top 8</span> Teams - proceed to the [[Rocket_League_Championship_Series/2021-22#Group Stage|Group Stage]].
<br>
*'''Group Stage''' - ''August 9th - 13th, 2022''
**16 teams split into 2 groups of 8.
**Double Elimination Bracket.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.
**<span class="bg-up">Top 4</span> Teams - 8 in total - advance to the [[Rocket League Championship Series/2021-22#Playoffs|Playoffs]].
<br>
*'''Playoffs''' - ''August 14th, 2022''
**Single Elimination Bracket.
***All matches are {{Abbr/Bo7}}.

